  "worked_solution": "We multiply each row in the matrix by the column vector using the dot product:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}By & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}6 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-3)+1\\cdot 1 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot 6+2\\cdot (-3)+(-1)\\cdot 1 \\\\ 4\\cdot 6+0\\cdot (-3)+(-3)\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}12-3+1 \\\\ -18-6-1 \\\\ 24-0-3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}10 \\\\ -25 \\\\ 21\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
